WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:08,040
Dad, we were really flying just now

2
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:17,020
Grandma, don’t panic. Dad, thank you, chief.

3
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:20,490
They are stronghold guards and will not harm you.

4
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:30,310
For new members, take them to dinner first and then arrange accommodation.

5
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:32,110
Got it, come with me
